[Sheet: Register]
Existing-DER Register Extract					
Source:	Interconnection Studies — system extract				
Extract job:	ICS-REG-EXT / weekly				
As of:	07/14/2025				
Scope:	In-service or previously in-service DER sites within Alleniom Utilities service territory at or above the 500 kW reporting floor. Sub-500 kW residential and small-commercial systems are held in the Simplified Small-Systems Register and are not included in this extract.				
Column definitions					
Service Address	premise address of record from the customer information system.				
Customer	customer of record on the service account.				
Site Name	DER site label as carried in the interconnection master.				
Nameplate (kW)	as-built AC nameplate at point of interconnection.				
Commissioned	date of first energization from the commissioning record on file.				
Current Status	most recent operational / telemetry status of record. Values in this field reflect the state of the site as reported by the SOC or the last commissioning entry; the register does not evaluate suitability for standards retrofit or upgrade. Cells in this column are color-coded per the status key in Notes, item 6.				
