[Sheet: Notes]
Notes	
1.	Rows are ordered by commissioned date, oldest first, then by service address.
2.	"Pre-TCS-02" annotations indicate the site was energized before the effective date of the Telemetry & Communications Standard (TCS-02, effective 06/01/2021) and was accepted under the telemetry provisions in force at commissioning. This annotation does not confer a permanent exemption: per TCS-02 §2(d), a pre-TCS-02 site is brought into TCS-02 scope when it is the subject of a new interconnection application. Status values in this column are informational; this register does not independently determine upgrade eligibility or compliance.
3.	Sites listed as decommissioned or inactive are retained in the register for address-history purposes and are excluded from active-DER counts.
4.	Address matches are performed on normalized premise address. Multiple DER at a single service address are listed as separate rows.
5.	Extract does not include applications currently in queue (see Active Queue Report).
6.	Current Status color key: green = operational with TCS-02-compliant telemetry (utility RTU); amber = in service under a pre-TCS-02 telemetry arrangement (no telemetry or legacy analog/dial-up/modem/SCADA); red = decommissioned or inactive.